# 2. VitePress Badge Component — Full Support

Add support for VitePress's globally available `<Badge>` component.

This component must work inside documentation Markdown, including headings.

## Required syntax

```md
### Title <Badge type="info" text="default" />

### Title <Badge type="tip" text="^1.9.0" />

### Title <Badge type="warning" text="beta" />

### Title <Badge type="danger" text="deprecated" />
```

## Custom children

Support:

```md
### Title <Badge type="info">custom element</Badge>
```

The component must accept both text props and slot content.

When children are passed through the slot, they take priority over `text`.

## Supported badge types

